<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94069" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῐδηρ-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>overlay with iron</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιδηρώσας ἐπὶ πολὺ τῆς ὁρμιᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Pisc.</u>
					51
				</span></i>
			:—mostly 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσεσιδήρωτο ἐπὶ μέγα καὶ
				τοῦ ἄλλου ξύλου</span>
			<i>iron had been laid</i> over a great part of the rest of the
			wood, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.100
			</span></i>, cf. Aen. Tact.<i><span class="en">
				20.2
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥρυμοὶ σεσιδηρωμένοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12.313.21
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δράκοντα σεσιδηρωμένον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Posidipp.
					26.8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>put in irons, fetter, P Lond.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				2.422.1
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>.</div>
